OL,3,GNEWSASt Helens pub in running for
OL,4,Anational honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA much-loved local pub is in contention
OL,7,Ffor one of the country's most
OL,8,Fprestigious pub honours, after reaching
OL,9,Fthe final stage of a national
OL,10,Fcompetition.
OL,12,FThe Turks Head, in St Helens, is one of
OL,13,Fjust four pubs shortlisted for the
OL,14,FCampaign for Real Ale (CAMRA) National
OL,15,FPub of the Year award.
OL,17,FThe Tudor-style venue, which dates back
OL,18,Fto the 1870s, has already gone one
OL,19,Fbetter than previous years by
OL,20,Fprogressing beyond the regional stage
OL,21,Fto the final four.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
