OL,3,GNEWSASt Helens pub in running for
OL,4,Anational honour
OL,5,
OL,6,FLicensee Clare Harrison, said: "To say
OL,7,Fwe're over the moon is an
OL,8,Funderstatement. We're incredibly proud
OL,9,Fto have reached the final four pubs,
OL,10,Fand to be representing St Helens at
OL,11,Fthis level is honestly a dream come
OL,12,Ftrue."
